125: ## 3. Caveats
126: 
127: - In `src/commands/pii.ts`, `ctx.ui.setStatus` and `ctx.ui.notify` are also accessed. Slash commands are interactive by nature (executed within an active UI session), so headless invocation of slash commands is rare. However, applying optional chaining there during command refactoring is recommended.
128: - In `tests/empiric-challenge-2.test.ts:28-42`, the test was written as an empirical bug reproducer expecting `.rejects.toThrow(...)`. Applying this fix will cause that specific assertion to fail until updated to expect `.resolves.toBeUndefined()` and verify headless execution.
